{"id":"n30199-1-10","stage":0,"title":"요리 · 烹饪","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n30199-1-10-1","ko":"어디에서 맛있는 냄새가 나는데?","zh":"哪儿飘来这么香的味道？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어디에서","meaning":"从哪里","explanation":"어디：哪里；-에서 在这里表示气味发出的地点。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디에서","audio":"/audio/b7f2498da0de7d9f1c85.mp3"}},{"text":"맛있는","meaning":"香的","explanation":"맛있다：味道好；修饰 냄새 时表示食物闻起来很香，-는 修饰名词。","readings":[{"term":"맛있다","audio":"/audio/21e91ac8a208ff9e520a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70811","senseId":"1","lemma":"맛있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맛있는","audio":"/audio/5adc05669a4242e46918.mp3"}},{"text":"냄새가","meaning":"香味","explanation":"냄새：气味；这里指闻到的食物香味，-가 标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"냄새","audio":"/audio/a67d0d1b921d4bc49922.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58180","senseId":"1","lemma":"냄새","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"냄새가","audio":"/audio/355d1601ad77a55c071d.mp3"}},{"text":"나는데?","meaning":"飘来呢","explanation":"나다：气味散发出来；-는데? 在句末表达发现并询问香味的来源。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"16","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나는데","audio":"/audio/38bceaf18f2d7fee5937.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"21e91ac8a208ff9e","term":"맛있다","zh":"香、好闻（食物气味）","audio":"/audio/21e91ac8a208ff9e520a.mp3","entryId":"70811","definition":"食物味道好；这里修饰气味，表示闻起来很香。","pronunciation":["마딛따","마싣따"]},{"id":"a67d0d1b921d4bc4","term":"냄새","zh":"气味，味道，香味，臭味","audio":"/audio/a67d0d1b921d4bc49922.mp3","entryId":"58180","definition":"能用鼻子闻到的味儿。","pronunciation":["냄ː새"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"发出，泛出，响出，有","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"产生能察觉到的声音或气味等。","pronunciation":["나다"]}],"audio":"/audio/287d94949b9f98e891b0.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n30199-1-10-2","ko":"어머니가 지금 부엌에서 요리를 하고 계시거든.","zh":"因为妈妈现在正在厨房做饭呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어머니가","meaning":"母亲，妈妈","explanation":"어머니：母亲，妈妈；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"어머니","audio":"/audio/a8f7e3b1e379f4880b79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74361","senseId":"1","lemma":"어머니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어머니가","audio":"/audio/7180d98b45bfbcfa2667.mp3"}},{"text":"지금","meaning":"现在","explanation":"지금：现在。","readings":[{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62522","senseId":"1","lemma":"지금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}},{"text":"부엌에서","meaning":"在厨房","explanation":"부엌：厨房；-에서 标记做饭的地点。","readings":[{"term":"부엌","audio":"/audio/332e6d9dbea912568fe5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62273","senseId":"1","lemma":"부엌","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"부엌에서","audio":"/audio/888945bcc6b206e46a7c.mp3"}},{"text":"요리를","meaning":"做饭","explanation":"요리：烹饪、做饭；-를 标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"요리","audio":"/audio/aa664b105a07ea19ff3e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30199","senseId":"1","lemma":"요리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요리를","audio":"/audio/31a08bc8142e3b567a62.mp3"}},{"text":"하고","meaning":"正在做","explanation":"하다：做；-고 与后面的 계시다 合用，表示动作正在进行。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하고","audio":"/audio/1a7140c02481d065b267.mp3"}},{"text":"계시거든.","meaning":"正在呢（敬语）","explanation":"-고 계시다：尊敬主语的正在进行表达；-거든 